| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Website 1 (lichess.org) | 50 Samples | 4 ms | 25093 ms | 2732.05 ms |
| Website 1 (lichess.org) | 100 Samples | 0 ms | 39672 ms | 2692 ms |
| Website 2 (mydramalist.com) | 50 Samples | 47 ms | 24169 ms | 2847.56 ms |
| Website 2 (mydramalist.com) | 100 Samples | 40 ms | 27338 ms | 2152.10 ms |


2. Comparison of Throughput and Data Transfer
The following table compares the Average Throughput and network data transfer rates (Reception and Transmission) based on the 100-second ramp-up constraint. 

