| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Website 1 | 50 Samples | 13.31 | 77.79 | 9.00 |
| Website 1 | 100 Samples | 27.32 | 156.86 | 18.57 |
| Website 2 | 50 Samples | 10.86 | 98.13 | 6.84 |
| Website 2 | 100 Samples | 35.66 | 309.60 | 21.31 |